stateDiagram-v2
  state "S-D03-029-01 없음" as empty
  state "S-D03-029-02 소유보행" as leased
  state "S-D03-029-03 보관" as saved
  state "S-D03-029-04 종료" as ended
  state "S-D03-029-05 만료" as expired
  state "S-D03-029-06 삭제실패" as blocked
  [*] --> empty
  empty --> leased: bind account and begin walk
  leased --> saved: first validated route sealed and read back
  saved --> saved: reroute does not replace first archive
  saved --> ended: end walk or account boundary
  saved --> expired: 24h or reboot or invalid clock relation
  ended --> empty: verified clear
  expired --> empty: verified clear
  ended --> blocked: purge failed
  expired --> blocked: purge failed
  blocked --> empty: scope bound purge succeeds
